     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Same level: left to right",
     "md": "Division and multiplication have the **same rank**, so we go from left to right: 24 ÷ 4 × 3 = 6 × 3 = 18. Addition and subtraction also have the same rank: 10 − 3 + 2 = 7 + 2 = 9."
    },
